{"ref":"BDB, מָכִיר","hw":"מָכִיר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מָכִיר</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> 𝔊 Μαχειρ <strong>(</strong>Sab. <span dir=\"rtl\">מכר</span> Hal<sup>4</sup><strong>)</strong>.<br><strong>1.</strong>  eldest son of Manasseh;—<a data-ref=\"Genesis 50:23\" href=\"/Genesis.50.23\">Gn 50:23</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:29\" href=\"/Numbers.26.29\">Nu 26:29</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 27:1\" href=\"/Numbers.27.1\">27:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:39\" href=\"/Numbers.32.39\">32:39</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:40\" href=\"/Numbers.32.40\">40</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 36:1\" href=\"/Numbers.36.1\">36:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.15\">Dt 3:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:31\" href=\"/Joshua.13.31\">Jos 13:31</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 17:1\" href=\"/Joshua.17.1\">17:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 17:3\" href=\"/Joshua.17.3\">3</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:21\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.21\">1 Ch 2:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.23\">23</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:14\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.14\">7:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:17\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.17\">17</a>; v. also <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:14\" href=\"/Judges.5.14\">Ju 5:14</a> (poet.) where = Manasseh.<br><strong>2.</strong>  son of `Ammiel <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 9:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.9.4\">2 S 9:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 9:5\" href=\"/II_Samuel.9.5\">5</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:27\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.27\">17:27</a>.","next":"BDB, מָכִירִי","prev":"BDB, מֶ֫כֶר"}